  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 3 difficulties use direct public level 35, 67, 72, 81 and 90 values, while encounter member 107 uses direct public level 50 values; no interpolation is used.",
    "Phase entry programs immediately summon one Soldier plus one Cannoneer, then two Cannoneers, then two Silvermane Lieutenants (Complete), clearing the prior phase summons.",
    "Phase one follows Besiege, Frigid Waterfall, Tit for Tat and Fist of Conviction; phases two and three preserve the opening, shielded and unshielded public action rotations with paired extra actions.",
    "Frigid Waterfall deals 380% Ice damage to all opponents and permanently stacks 12% ordinary-damage amplification.",
    "Garrison Aura Field preserves the exact aggregate 40%-per-friendly-unit shield amount by allocating equal 40% Gepard-Max-HP slices to present allies; the shield effect records the public Toughness-protection semantic.",
    "Besiege applies Lock On and queues one forced coordinated strike for every surviving Gepard-owned summon against the selected target.",
    "Tit for Tat lasts one turn, queues Smite of Frost against the first attacker, and removes itself after that one counter.",
    "The three phase graphs, phase-entry summons, shields, forced coordinated actions, counter trigger and damage modifiers use shared Rule IR without a native handler."
  ]
